      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic. The subject shown in <Picture 1> holds their position and appearance, and the surrounding layout is preserved exactly as referenced. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. Soft natural light falls from the left, shallow depth of field keeps the background gently out of focus, and fine detail stays crisp on the subject. Ambient air moves slightly, disturbing loose fabric and stray hair at a natural pace. Colour is neutral and filmic, with clean highlight roll-off and no visible sharpening.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet room tone sits under the shot, with faint air movement and the soft rustle of fabric as the subject settles.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sustained low strings at a slow tempo, widely spaced, kept well beneath the ambience.",
        864,
